'''Spheric Guardian''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] that appears in [[Act 2]] and [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Spheric Guardian}}
'''Spheric Guardian''' always starts with {{Int|Spheric Guardian|Activate}}, then uses {{Int|Spheric Guardian|Debuff Attack}}. Afterwards, '''Spheric Guardian''' alternates between using {{Int|Spheric Guardian|Slam}} and {{Int|Spheric Guardian|Harden}} for the rest of the battle.

== In Party With ==
=== Act 2 ===
As an easy pool encounter:
* Solo

As a hard pool encounter alongside:
* 1 {{M|Sentry}}

=== Act 3 ===
As a hard pool encounter alongside:
* 2 random [[Shapes]]

== Tips ==
* Cards that remove or do damage through {{KW|Block}} are very useful against {{M|Spheric Guardian}}, as it has low HP.
** {{C|Melter}} is very helpful for removing {{KW|Block}}, and {{C|Judgment}} will instantly kill a {{M|Spheric Guardian}} regardless of its {{KW|Block}}.

== Trivia ==
* {{M|Spheric Guardian}} appears in the card art for {{C|Melter}}.

